<title>USA: Advanced Machine buys back shrs, warrants.</title>
<headline>Advanced Machine buys back shrs, warrants.</headline>
<dateline>MEDFORD, Ore. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Machine Vision Corp said Wednesday that it purchased in a private transaction 1,001,640 shares of outstanding Class A common stock and 640,000 warrants to purchase class A common stock for total consideration of $1.9 million.</p>
<p>The company said the purchase represents a reduction of about 7.5 percent in the number of outstanding shares and the elimination of another 640,000 potentially issuable shares.</p>
